{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S03\",\"screen\":\"20–21小节忽然冒出几句短促、急切的声音\",\"source\":\"约在第20–21小节，持续摇曳中忽然冒出几句短促、稍显急切的声音\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿用“约在”表示小节位置是近似的，屏幕稿去掉限定，变成了确定的精确定位。\"},{\"sec\":\"S03\",\"screen\":\"20–22小节又像被风吹碎的倒影\",\"source\":\"约在第20–22小节，平稳的“对话”有一种被水下暗流拖住的感觉\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿用“约在”表示近似定位，屏幕稿去掉限定，变成了确定的精确定位。\"},{\"sec\":\"S08\",\"screen\":\"71小节正以为还会继续唱，它却突然停住\",\"source\":\"约第71小节，正当你以为它还会继续唱下去，它却戛然而止\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿明确保留了第71小节的近似性，屏幕稿去掉“约”，把时间定位写成了确定值。\"},{\"sec\":\"S14\",\"screen\":\"113小节，熟悉的声响像从很远的地方应了一声\",\"source\":\"第113小节附近，熟悉的声响像隔着很远应了一声\",\"type\":\"2\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿说的是第113小节附近，屏幕稿改成确定的第113小节，缩小了原本保留的时间范围。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "21a9205c-a8b6-48c7-a748-aa027024c6c3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T070119690225Z", "elapsed_seconds": 420.609, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T07:08:20.293383+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6940967c951d7d6972fb4f5080d3167f2f021341db14edfbd40560bb2d6c9fb9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_p